        "Description": "Welcome agent.\rMarshall, Carter &amp; Dark, Ltd tasked us with eliminating &quot;Silvio Caruso&quot;, one of their ex-client who didn&apos;t pay a lot of things he bought from them.\rEliminate him, is personal bodyguard, the security chief, is wife &quot;Tamara&quot; and is little sister &quot;Lisa&quot;, MC&amp;DLtd want to take all he got to have the equivalent of what he owed them, and so they can&apos;t let anyone try to have the heritage.\rCan eliminate hostiles if needed\rGood luck agent.\r\r[This contract got personnaly sended by Mr. Dark]",
